{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order: the New Dawn is a colony sim with space adventure. Step into the role of a legendary captain and lead your elite team to forge an epic tale on the desert planet of New Terra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a legendary captain from the United Stellar. While leading your team to suppress a galaxy-spanning rebellion, you\u2019re pulled into the Initial Rift\u2014an isolated star region lost to time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, the last known civilization\u2014the Terra Kingdom\u2014has long fallen. Its homeworld destroyed two centuries ago, its people now scattered across broken worlds: surviving in hiding, raiding for scraps, or clinging to fading strongholds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly connected star system maps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/62e0ef3d53cb1a98805d4a73bb464473.poster.avif?t=1769492927\" width=800 height=265 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/62e0ef3d53cb1a98805d4a73bb464473.webm?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Derelict space facilities to explore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/d31f651fff34b96dd27396fab1c9b887.poster.avif?t=1769492927\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/d31f651fff34b96dd27396fab1c9b887.webm?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/d31f651fff34b96dd27396fab1c9b887.mp4?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building an Interstellar Transportation Network</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/9ba4ac2e41d513331c008993e8a87679.poster.avif?t=1769492927\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/9ba4ac2e41d513331c008993e8a87679.webm?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/9ba4ac2e41d513331c008993e8a87679.mp4?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown planets waiting for discovery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/7da21f7175d3cad3d3a63beadf03fc38.poster.avif?t=1769492927\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/7da21f7175d3cad3d3a63beadf03fc38.webm?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/7da21f7175d3cad3d3a63beadf03fc38.mp4?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surface resources ripe for collection</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/0bba19003ac052bb7df64c0fc0099c65.poster.avif?t=1769492927\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/0bba19003ac052bb7df64c0fc0099c65.webm?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/0bba19003ac052bb7df64c0fc0099c65.mp4?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colonies built from the ground up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/93aaeabef7e9f62081c7646bd1f5c040.poster.avif?t=1769492927\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/93aaeabef7e9f62081c7646bd1f5c040.webm?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/93aaeabef7e9f62081c7646bd1f5c040.mp4?t=1769492927\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rebuild order, watch it crumble, or plunge the stars into deeper chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness advanced United Stellar technology to gather resources, unlock research, and expand your domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your base room by room. Assemble space fleets. Construct planetary hubs and system-spanning megastructures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore scorching deserts, frozen tundras, volcanic wastelands, ruined ground cities, orbital relics\u2014and twisted alien hives choked in bio-contamination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the Wastespace begins with your first outpost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3080070/extras/26a8441201e1d4768af08291f1